Obviously it couldn't be real, but if we assume it is, obviously no, but

82
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:09,438
- It's definitely true. - Well, it can't be true, but how...

83
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,710
'How' is the easy part.

84
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:16,590
You just go somewhere dark. A big closet is usually good; the bathroom works in a pinch.

