1438
01:36:28,560 --> 01:36:32,348
Kitcat just came out crying buckets, and now you too.

1439
01:36:32,440 --> 01:36:33,919
No matter what Mom says?

1440
01:36:34,120 --> 01:36:36,315
- The truth - Right.

1441
01:36:37,520 --> 01:36:39,158
That aside,

1442
01:36:40,080 --> 01:36:45,677
I think it was because of smoking, but it couldn't be helped since it was before you were born.

1443
01:36:46,400 --> 01:36:48,789
Even so, if it weren't for me smoking so sexily,

1444
01:36:48,880 --> 01:36:51,348
