1456
01:37:57,360 --> 01:38:01,035
- Sorry - If we use time travel...

1457
01:38:01,680 --> 01:38:06,037
No, I never said we could fix it with that.

1458
01:38:06,160 --> 01:38:08,674
Life is unpredictable, no matter whose life it is.

1459
01:38:08,800 --> 01:38:12,793
Look at Jesus; even though he was God's son, what happened in the end?

1460
01:38:12,920 --> 01:38:14,148
I know, but...

1461
01:38:15,120 --> 01:38:17,588
