1462
01:38:17,720 --> 01:38:22,748
Don't say that. Try thinking the other way: the only people who want to play ping pong more often with their sons when they retire at fifty are cancer-stricken time travelers.

1463
01:38:22,880 --> 01:38:27,556
Is that so?

1464
01:38:29,680 --> 01:38:30,669
