1470
01:38:56,800 --> 01:38:58,836
It's not as dramatic as last time, but it's much more important.

1471
01:38:59,680 --> 01:39:02,831
Seriously amazing.

1472
01:39:03,600 --> 01:39:06,273
Please tell me.

1473
01:39:08,840 --> 01:39:11,354
Since saving time is better,

1474
01:39:11,680 --> 01:39:13,636
he then gave me his formula for happiness.

1475
01:39:18,880 --> 01:39:22,509
The first step among the two is to live an ordinary life.

1476
01:39:24,560 --> 01:39:28,792
Just like everyone else every day.

1477
01:39:28,880 --> 01:39:31,872
The current status is highlighted in this revision.

1478
01:39:37,400 --> 01:39:42,235
Rupert, Rupert, is this the best we can do?

1479
01:39:45,560 --> 01:39:47,869
Of course not. I'll revise it.

